==Trivia==
* This is the first Japanese ending in {{aniseries|DP}} that wasn't updated with additions or [[Evolution]]s to the main characters' teams, although this does fit with the "memories" theme of the song.
* A new version with a slightly different arrangement sung by [[Megumi Toyoguchi]] ({{an|Dawn}}'s Japanese voice actor) is featured in [[Which One ~ Is It? (CD)|the CD release]] of [[Which One ~ Is It?]].
* This is the first ''[[Pokémon the Series: Diamond and Pearl]]'' ending theme to not have any human characters physically appear.

===Errors===
* In the scene where all of the Pokémon are running towards Piplup, [[Dawn's Ambipom]] is nowhere to be seen.

